  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A particle moves in the <math><mi>x</mi></math>-<math><mi>y</mi></math> plane under the action of a force <math><mi>F</mi></math> such that the coordinates of its linear momentum <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>at any time <math><mi>t</mi></math> is <math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> cos <math><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mn></mn></math><math><mn>= 2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />\rThe angel <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> at a given time <math><mi>t</mi></math> will be</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Fv3O1",
      "text": "<math><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math>",
