  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></msqrt></math><br/><br/><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br/><br/>If <math><mi>m</mi></math> be the mass of the body, then kinetic energy<br/><br/><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>Since kinetic energy does not change with time, both work done and power are zero<br/><br/>Now  Power = <math><mi>F</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br/><br/>As <math><mi>F</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br/><br/><math><mo>∴</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br/><br/>Or  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math><br/><br/>As direction of <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is same that <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>(</mo><mo>∵</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math> hence angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is equal to <math><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math>",
